{"day":174,"title":"如何用Jev在浏览器上做选择题","summary":"今天教大家如何用Jev操控电脑。","content":"今天教大家如何用Jev操控电脑。\n\nJev既然最强的是做判断，那么选择题是最适配它的形式。\n\n不管是考试，还是各种各样的测试题，我都想用Jev来测试下效果。\n\n我们的目标是：直接让 Jev 操作浏览器答题。\n\n操作步骤：\n\n1、安装Jev for Chrome扩展\n\n直通地址：https://github.com/chy4pro/jev-for-chrome\n\n[IMG:0]\n\n直接发给你的Codex让他安装就行了\n\n[IMG:1]\n\n在设置中填写 TypeSafe API Key。\n\n[IMG:2]\n\n[IMG:3]\n\n这里的TypeSafe API Key需要你在官网进行创建\n\n[IMG:4]\n\n2、打开做题网页\n\n这里我打开了一个16人格的测试网页。\n\n[IMG:5]\n\n3、直接打开插件，输入以下内容\n\n完成当前页面的48道MBTI题。以一个虚构的INTJ人格一致作答，每题点击最符合的选项，继续到下一题，到结果页停止。\n\n4、等待执行完毕皆可\n\n整个的执行过程我每个视频平台都发了，感兴趣的可以看看","tags":["AI","工具"],"cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2Zia5tWSYZCqxh0uFZQEWnyRX34KgAicb2N39eIjtgZ40rwtSkhMuPfz0ZUIlC6vFicKnHP6bEeeaJRROgWsBvvbnmqQD16pkCDXvmP1XxaSp0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","images":["https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCrEb7FGHicY6ZJpmoIqpibUG5grfibW8ToNLmRxAYPDI3VaFWSCiayYtLOAAsXb8ia25e6OzI6WN6mY3bcr8shF7ZEWZGxdfo5msJt0/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCph34b8sYVHp0vlf4EmPuvckrMfDgcBEDyQyntB8AJ4EniaCZlujmbgFsJJibCibckVlelib97XBhV7kLlc8NZQay5ZEwMQU5Xkcb8/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCpt5ia5Kd6lzUyHE0un1Jaj9KAxxvv7nf7jU0y47IicaXibT1wTUnibNOiaEEsF17VHGgboABpibVOiaMRUNFE8lITWEibicjIbp7YbIzyc/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCp3VVtVaL0jb957OeOsIRfLTfy8iaZPicSh1Jy33IlS8jNiaRp9coadyy20KyKVfz2qwGHfR1wIibpa2mpCI7xkFDjNJCexx1ibpiawc/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCqRmBrAKmxnRTQS7gfjWc9vzbEBep0A85ZYUq13YBS0jGF9iayeRvWic7odnDjY3n3zza6R1cGC7CIWV4UhC8r7Olrzn62qMFyLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2Zia5tWSYZCp4QCcLwC5zZb28JzGCn2eNiaU2cBqbQAuTlN11ke2IXznP00l9DxoibX4ch1quL0gWicYPuEtTFq8E3xSicA92tnvjjbt647WeKoU/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"],"slug":"day-174","publishedAt":"2026-09-22"}